{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Echoes Lie</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror game where you explore a haunted house, uncover memories, and face the consequences of Joe\u2019s guilt and fading sanity. Every sound hides a lie. Every choice changes his fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person psychological horror experience.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, interact, and uncover hidden memories within the house.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape Joe\u2019s fate and the story\u2019s ending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/bcfdaf9bf179f3a3b868b5d2589b21b2.poster.avif?t=1763127120\" width=716 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/bcfdaf9bf179f3a3b868b5d2589b21b2.webm?t=1763127120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/bcfdaf9bf179f3a3b868b5d2589b21b2.mp4?t=1763127120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NOTHING IS THE SAME AFTER THE ACCIDENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive Jo\u2019s fractured mind and face the truth buried in his past.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The line between memory and madness fades with every step.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/25a905b7fade056db6ed3efbfca4222f.poster.avif?t=1763127120\" width=718 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/25a905b7fade056db6ed3efbfca4222f.webm?t=1763127120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/25a905b7fade056db6ed3efbfca4222f.mp4?t=1763127120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story doesn\u2019t end with a single playthrough.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the game to find hidden fragments that bring you closer to the truth.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three main endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/88b38ed2cfa3c936bdf26e40e0877069.poster.avif?t=1763127120\" width=717 height=397 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4160870/extras/88b38ed2cfa3c936bdf26e40e0877069.webm?t=1763127120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI Content Disclosure</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses AI to generate some textures, scripts, and voice lines. All AI-generated content is original and created by the developer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4160870?t=1763127120","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4160870?t=1763127120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/416